      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Attempted a workaround involving the Unity Audio Mixer, however I am running into the same issue. The filter is not applied, however the audio remains 3d/spatial. Interestingly, effects applied on the Audio Listener itself are applied, however this doesn't help as it can't distinguish between sources.",
