  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I would like to be able to add a highpass/lowpass filter to the stream audio sources on the UdonSharpVideo player (AVPro). The goal is to end up with L/R highpassed sources and a 3rd mono lowpassed source.\n\nThis article further explains the issue and some not-very-ideal workarounds: https://vrclibrary.com/wiki/books/inprogress-multi-channel-live-audio-streams/page/guide\n\nreferencing this earlier request on the same topic: https://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/986-avpro-player-ignores-lowpass-reverb-and-other-filters\n\nmore users experiencing the same issue: https://feedback.vrchat.com/sdk-bug-reports/p/avpro-video-player-audio-filter-issue\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/sdk-bug-reports/p/sound-effects-are-not-applied-to-audiosource-using-avpro-that-comes-with-sdk3",
